{'symbol': 'COO', 'date': '2022-08-09 16:15:00', 'title': 'COOPERCOMPANIES APPOINTS NICHOLAS KHADDER\xa0AS GENERAL COUNSEL AND CORPORATE SECRETARY', 'text': 'SAN RAMON, CALIF., AUG. 09, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COOPERCOMPANIES (NYSE: COO) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT NICHOLAS KHADDER HAS BEEN APPOINTED AS ITS GENERAL COUNSEL AND CORPORATE SECRETARY. KHADDER JOINS COOPER HAVING PREVIOUSLY SERVED AS GENERAL COUNSEL OF STANDARD BIOTOOLS INC. (FORMERLY FLUIDIGM CORPORATION) FROM JUNE 2016 TO JULY 2022.'}